    "# Capstone Exercise: Autonomous Physical AI Assistant for Smart Environments\n",
    "\n",
    "## Overview\n",
    "This capstone exercise integrates all concepts learned throughout the Physical AI & Humanoid Robotics textbook. You will implement and evaluate a complete Physical AI system that operates autonomously in a smart environment, performing complex tasks while ensuring safety and efficiency.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Learning Objectives\n",
    "- Integrate perception, cognition, control, and human-robot interaction systems\n",
    "- Implement safe and efficient navigation in dynamic environments\n",
    "- Create adaptive behavior based on environmental conditions\n",
    "- Evaluate system performance using multiple metrics\n",
    "- Demonstrate advanced AI capabilities in a real-world scenario\n",
    "\n",
    "## Prerequisites\n",
    "Before starting this exercise, ensure you have completed:\n",
    "- All previous modules (1-4)\n",
    "- Understanding of ROS 2 concepts and navigation stack\n",
    "- Experience with simulation environments\n",
    "- Basic knowledge of AI/ML for robotics\n",
    "- Familiarity with perception and control systems"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Problem Statement\n",
    "\n",
    "You are tasked with developing an autonomous Physical AI system for a smart office environment. The system must:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Navigate safely through a complex office environment with multiple rooms\n",
    "2. Perform delivery tasks (documents, objects) to designated locations\n",
    "3. Interact safely and effectively with humans in the environment\n",
    "4. Adapt its behavior based on environmental conditions and priorities\n",
    "5. Handle unexpected situations and emergencies gracefully\n",
    "\n",
    "### Environment Setup\n",
    "The simulation environment includes:\n",
    "- Multiple office rooms (offices, conference rooms, kitchen, reception)\n",
    "- Dynamic obstacles (simulated humans moving around)\n",
    "- Various objects for manipulation (documents, cups, tools)\n",
    "- Sensor-equipped humanoid robot\n",
    "- Complete ROS 2 simulation stack"
   ]
  },
